  seoEnIndustrial: [
    "Equsto is a Turkey-based industrial kitchen platform for restaurants, hotels, cloud kitchens and catering operations. Authorized Öztiryakiler distribution covers cooking, refrigeration, warewashing, prep, coffee and beverage lines in one catalog flow.",
    "Export markets include selected countries in the Gulf, Central Asia and Eastern Europe. Single-SKU orders and full project equipment lists use the same catalog and quote workflow. Live FX rates apply to list prices in EUR and TRY.",
    "Project Factory (PFOS) generates equipment lists and quote summaries from concept, capacity and menu inputs. Target turnaround is about five minutes for a draft quote. Final pricing and logistics are confirmed by sales engineering.",
    "This is B2B commercial kitchen supply, not table reservation or POS software. SKU and product codes appear in structured PDF quote lines. VAT and freight lines are shown excluding tax where applicable.",
    "Sales engineering validates gas pressure, electrical load and hood requirements on site before purchase orders. Installation and commissioning follow the same project plan. Training and warranty registration complete handover.",
    "Gastronomy design refines layout, ergonomics and HACCP flows after the draft list. CAD drawings can be added in a later phase. Site measurements are the first critical PFOS inputs.",
    "Reference pages explain equipment logic in a disassembled case format; they are learning resources, not fixed packages. Sample tables link to live catalog SKUs. Full lists are project-specific.",
    "Steakhouse, fine dining, fast food, hotel all-day dining and cloud kitchen scenarios use dedicated PFOS concepts. Cold room and high-volume catering may need separate engineering review. Contact channel handles OEM requests.",
    "Atalay and other selected brands complement the Öztiryakiler core in cooking and refrigeration. Bar Design Studio plans modular beverage stations with Besos modules where applicable. 2026 pricing is maintained in TRY unless stated.",
    "Service regions include Turkey, the Middle East, the Caucasus, Central Asia and the Balkans. Project discounts apply during quoting. Freight and installation lines are summarized in the quote file.",
    "Blog and GEO guides answer concept and quotation questions separately from the product catalog. Footer and sitemap support discovery. Industrial buyers can start in PFOS or contact sales directly.",
    "Energy planning and MEP reserves matter for high-output lines. Grease traps and exhaust capacity scale with cooking intensity. Hygiene zoning separates prep, cooking and warewashing.",
    "After sales engineering approval, ordering and installation scheduling begin. Warranty follows authorized dealer processes. Equsto publishes 2026 content for international industrial kitchen buyers.",
  ],
  seoEnQuotation: [
    "Project Factory generates equipment lists and quote summaries for commercial kitchen projects. Capacity, concept and menu inputs drive module counts through a rules engine. The output is a draft quotation file, not a final contract price.",
    "Target turnaround is about five minutes once required inputs are complete. VAT and logistics lines are included in the summary. Final sign-off is performed by the sales engineering team before purchase orders are issued.",
    "Layout and MEP can be refined later with gastronomy design and on-site verification. CAD plans are optional in the first step. Site dimensions and service style remain core PFOS fields.",
    "This workflow is B2B kitchen equipment supply, not restaurant reservation software. SKU rows in the PDF are structured for procurement review. Single-item orders and full projects share one catalog.",
    "Restaurant, hotel, café, catering, cloud kitchen and steakhouse concepts are supported. Seating versus takeaway mix changes refrigeration depth. Meal periods and covers per day affect warewashing speed.",
    "Authorized Öztiryakiler lines anchor cooking and refrigeration; complementary brands fill specific modules. Live exchange rates apply to list pricing. 2026 TRY prices are quoted excluding VAT unless noted.",
    "Sales engineering confirms gas, electricity, hood and drain conditions on site. Installation and commissioning are planned in the same project timeline. Training completes commissioning for operations teams.",
    "Sample equipment tables on GEO pages link to catalog SKUs. Full lists expand in PFOS by capacity and menu. Reference cases illustrate logic without replacing project-specific engineering.",
    "Export buyers in the Gulf, Central Asia and Eastern Europe can use the contact channel for freight clarity. Service regions are listed on the about and quote pages. Project discounts apply during quoting.",
    "Hot, cold and wash lines are generated together so procurement sees one coherent scope. Holding, prep and finishing modules follow service style. Cold room projects may require a separate engineering track.",
    "After approval, ordering and logistics scheduling begin. Warranty registration uses serial numbers captured at commissioning. Spare parts are handled through B2B channels.",
    "Blog and GEO content separates education from catalog browsing. Footer links connect concepts to PFOS. Industrial buyers should treat the five-minute file as a draft for engineering review.",
    "Start PFOS with concept and capacity, then refine with sales engineering; Project Factory is the 2026 quotation entry point.",
  ],
